*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%  PPD for the Bixolon XD5-43T generic "scale to fit" queue.
*%  Declares A4/A5/Letter as page sizes (matching normal source documents)
*%  rather than the physical 4x6in label -- see bixolon-xd5-43t-label.ppd
*%  for why: if this PPD only offered the label size, macOS's AirPrint
*%  client would pre-scale the whole source page down onto that tiny paper
*%  size itself before the job ever reaches our filter. Declaring the
*%  document's own likely sizes makes macOS pass pages through unscaled so
*%  the bixolonplain filter can do the real fit-to-label scaling itself.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*LanguageVersion: English
*PCFileName: "BIXPLAIN.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Bixolon"
*Product: "(XD5-43T)"
*ModelName: "Bixolon XD5-43T Scale To Fit"
*ShortNickName: "Bixolon XD5-43T Scale"
*NickName: "Bixolon XD5-43T Scale To Fit"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*TTRasterizer: None
*cupsVersion: 2.0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber: 1
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/vnd.cups-raw 0 bixolonplain"
*cupsFilter2: "application/postscript application/vnd.cups-raw 0 bixolonplain"
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-postscript application/vnd.cups-raw 0 bixolonplain"

*OpenUI *PageSize: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: ""
*PageSize A5/A5: ""
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: ""
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: ""
*PageRegion A5/A5: ""
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: ""
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "0 0 595 842"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "0 0 420 595"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "0 0 612 792"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "420 595"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*%*% End of PPD
